; POOL EXTENSION (sl-0200): WAKE RINGS — a ten-bolt SLOW full ring
; (2.6 t/s, ttl 110 ≈ 4.8 tiles) pulsing off the STALKER as it
; advances: the room fills with expanding wakes behind the pursuit
; and crossing between bolts is the play (36° spacing ≈ 1.8-tile
; gaps at 3 tiles out vs the 0.7 player). Slow bolts + long lead =
; the heavy pursuer reads as a tide, not a bullet. Pattern id 44;
; lead 36 (the radial danger class). Elite amber placeholder;
; identity data-keyed.

